{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937480/extras/5dc051c20fc808e96c6aee09c6635737.poster.avif?t=1769983896\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937480/extras/5dc051c20fc808e96c6aee09c6635737.webm?t=1769983896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937480/extras/5dc051c20fc808e96c6aee09c6635737.mp4?t=1769983896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Protocol is a hardcore isometric survival sim where two lives are always on the line: yours and your baby\u2019s. In this world, noise kills. Breaking glass, slammed doors, gunshots\u2014and even a hungry infant\u2019s cry\u2014draw the dead from every direction. Plan every move: scavenge formula and meds, craft weapons, slip in and out of houses quietly, and if things go south, sprint for the car and make a break for it\u2014risking a horde with the roar of the engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937480/extras/d6925dc814475f1497f8fd0310da1d66.poster.avif?t=1769983896\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937480/extras/d6925dc814475f1497f8fd0310da1d66.webm?t=1769983896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937480/extras/d6925dc814475f1497f8fd0310da1d66.mp4?t=1769983896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cities are procedurally generated: new districts, interior layouts, loot spots, and escape routes force you to rethink your strategy every run. Silence is your best ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care under pressure: monitor your baby\u2019s hunger and condition; feed and protect them during raids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound-driven survival: zombies react to noise\u2014shattered windows, footsteps, gunshots, and a baby\u2019s cry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural world: unique street grids and building interiors each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting and arsenal: find components, build and upgrade melee and ranged weapons. Set traps and fortify your safehouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactics and stealth: choose between sneaking past threats or going loud and fighting through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risky transportation: use your car, manage fuel, and remember\u2014noise equals danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player survival: a tense atmosphere where every decision has consequences.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937480?t=1769983896","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937480/e0f3424ce9e67e66f8f7de38f8067c3cb9d4849c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769983896","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937480/8bd93283cec0ebc56ad44962ce74983bd4f5dd69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769983896","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937480/8bd93283cec0ebc56ad44962ce74983bd4f5dd69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769983896","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4083660,"d