our strategy every run. Silence is your best ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care under pressure: monitor your baby\u2019s hunger and condition; feed and protect them during raids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound-driven survival: zombies react to noise\u2014shattered windows, footsteps, gunshots, and a baby\u2019s cry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural world: unique street grids and building interiors each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting and arsenal: find components, build and upgrade melee and ranged weapons. Set traps and fortify your safehouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactics and stealth: choose between sneaking past threats or going loud and fighting through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risky transportation: use your car, manage fuel, and remember\u2014noise equals danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player survival: a tense atmosphere where every decision has consequences.</p></li></ul>","developers":["RedRock Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937480/5e0fc1ce80c4cbab4c9222732e5ea87afbe8b346/header.jpg?t=1769983896","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937480/1349227113/b8370be3e2a97a2b87618b3e7aca1a0171e89d44/1756161555/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760376071","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937480/1349227113/b8370be3e2a97a2b87618b3e7aca1a0171e89d44/1756161555/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760376071","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937480/1349227113/b8370be3e2a97a2b87618b3e7aca1a0171e89d44/1756161555/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760376071","id":257188821,"name":"Gameplay "